<title>BELGIUM: SOLVAY SAYS FINALISES BULGARIAN SODI DEAL.</title>
<headline>SOLVAY SAYS FINALISES BULGARIAN SODI DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals and drugs group Solvay SA said on Tuesday it had finalised its purchase of 60 percent in Bulgarian soda ash producer Sodi from the Bulgarian Privatisation Agency.</p>
</text>
